## DBG-4 | thrown fork at squid: hit or miss, with a pig as control from the same spot
> forceload add 6400 6100
> pbot spawn bot1 6400 -60 6100 minecraft:overworld survival
> clear bot1
sleep 3
> summon minecraft:squid 6400 -59 6104 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["s1"],Attributes:[{Name:"generic.max_health",Base:300.0d}],Health:300f}
sleep 1
> tp bot1 6400 -60 6100 0 0
> pbot hold bot1 hearthandharvest:pitchfork
> zhh1 throw bot1 20
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=s1,limit=1] Health
> data get entity @e[tag=s1,limit=1] Air
> kill @e[tag=s1]
> summon minecraft:squid 6400 -59 6108 {PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["s2"],Attributes:[{Name:"generic.max_health",Base:300.0d}],Health:300f}
> tp bot1 6400 -60 6105 0 0
> pbot hold bot1 hearthandharvest:pitchfork
> zhh1 throw bot1 20
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=s2,limit=1] Health
look does a squid take the fork at all, NoAI or not
